  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Half-fill a large saucepan with water. Add a generous pinch of salt, then bring to the boil over high heat.\n• Cook spaghetti in the boiling water until 'al dente', 10 minutes.\n• Reserve some pasta water (1/3 cup for 2 people / 2/3 cup for 4 people). Drain spaghetti, then return to saucepan. TIP: 'Al dente' pasta is cooked through but still slightly firm in the centre.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-65f93c130f0082904e5c0408-955d41b7.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Peel and slice orange (see ingredients) into thin wedges.\n• Grate carrot.\n• Finely chop garlic.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-65f93c130f0082904e5c0408-c086c013.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a large frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat.\n• Cook plant-based mince, breaking up with a spoon, until just browned, 4-5 minutes.\n• Add garlic & herb seasoning and garlic and cook until fragrant, 1 minute.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-65f93c130f0082904e5c0408-5a0c927b.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Add passata, the brown sugar, vegetable stock powder, the plant-based butter and reserved pasta water. Cook until slightly thickened, 2-3 minutes.\n• Add plant-based basil pesto and cooked spaghetti. Toss to coat. Season to taste. Remove pan from heat.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-65f93c130f0082904e5c0408-dabacaca.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a medium bowl combine orange, carrot, mixed salad leaves and a drizzle of vinegar and olive oil. Season to taste.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-65f93c130f0082904e5c0408-d78f1edc.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide plant-based mince and pesto spaghetti between plates. Top with Parmesan cheese and flaked almonds.\n• Serve with garden salad. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-65f93c130f0082904e5c0408-889060ee.jpeg"
    }
  ]
